WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 6=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:51.079 --> 01:52.879
I don't want
to bear Young Master's child.

01:53.879 --> 01:54.719
What about you?

01:57.920 --> 01:59.079
Why don't you want to?

02:00.760 --> 02:01.920
My mother told me

02:02.488 --> 02:03.920
I must never become a concubine.

02:04.599 --> 02:06.640
If I marry, I should marry properly

02:06.840 --> 02:08.159
and become a lawful wife.

02:08.800 --> 02:10.080
Even if life is hard,

02:10.152 --> 02:12.080
as long as husband
and wife talk things through,

02:12.120 --> 02:13.640
they can still live happily together.

02:14.840 --> 02:15.879
Lanxiang,

02:16.319 --> 02:18.120
don't bear Young Master's child either.

02:18.639 --> 02:19.639
My grandmother told me

02:19.960 --> 02:21.599
women like us, with no proper status,

02:21.599 --> 02:23.039
are bound to come to a bad end.

02:24.439 --> 02:26.199
I don't want to come to a bad end.

02:26.599 --> 02:27.520
In this residence,

02:28.080 --> 02:29.680
you're my favorite person.

02:30.400 --> 02:32.439
I don't want you
to come to a bad end, either.

02:36.120 --> 02:36.840
All right.

02:38.000 --> 02:38.719
Don't cry.

02:41.840 --> 02:44.800
Maybe Young Master
won't even take a liking to us.

02:48.000 --> 02:49.319
Really?

02:50.759 --> 02:53.919
You think Young Master won't like us?

02:58.479 --> 02:59.520
Then from now on,

02:59.599 --> 03:00.690
I won't slack off anymore.

03:00.800 --> 03:03.032
I'll kowtow to the Bodhisattva
three times every day.

03:04.520 --> 03:05.039
No.

03:05.080 --> 03:06.280
Six times. Three more for you.

03:06.290 --> 03:07.950
I'll pray that
the Bodhisattva blesses us

03:08.008 --> 03:10.120
so Young Master won't take
a liking to either of us.

03:10.200 --> 03:11.416
I'll kowtow three more times

03:11.448 --> 03:13.520
and pray that the Bodhisattva
blesses Young Madam

03:13.560 --> 03:14.280
with a child soon.

03:16.120 --> 03:17.560
I don't really like Young Madam,

03:17.719 --> 03:19.159
but if she has a child,

03:19.319 --> 03:21.240
we won't have
to bear Young Master's children.

03:25.039 --> 03:26.080
Lanxiang,

03:27.360 --> 03:28.400
what are you laughing at?

03:30.280 --> 03:31.240
You remind me

03:33.599 --> 03:35.879
of a girl I knew in the capital.

03:37.120 --> 03:39.960
Her name also had
the character "Lian" in it.

03:41.319 --> 03:43.000
The capital?

03:43.520 --> 03:45.199
Isn't that really far away?

03:45.800 --> 03:47.360
It must be hard to see her again, right?

03:51.879 --> 03:53.960
Very far away.

03:56.120 --> 03:57.680
I'll never see her again.

04:06.159 --> 04:06.960
Someday,

04:10.719 --> 04:12.840
you might have a chance
to go to the capital.

04:13.919 --> 04:14.560
Maybe

04:15.520 --> 04:16.879
we'll both get the chance.

04:37.192 --> 04:39.256
I heard you've been
promoted to second-class maids.

04:44.232 --> 04:45.070
Congratulations.

04:52.480 --> 04:53.879
Young Madam is very strict.

04:55.040 --> 04:56.839
I'm a little scared

04:59.360 --> 05:00.240
to serve her directly.

05:22.240 --> 05:23.240
You and Lanxiang

05:23.600 --> 05:25.399
aren't the type to stir up trouble.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.240
Just be careful.

05:27.288 --> 05:28.700
No matter how strict Young Madam is,

05:28.800 --> 05:29.920
she can't punish someone

05:30.079 --> 05:31.240
for no reason.

05:35.319 --> 05:36.439
Do you think

05:37.639 --> 05:40.759
Ji'er really stole the ring?

05:46.240 --> 05:46.920
Lanxiang,

05:47.399 --> 05:48.240
what do you think?

05:49.639 --> 05:51.560
You and Ji'er grew up together

05:51.560 --> 05:52.936
in the same servants' quarters.

05:58.552 --> 05:59.310
(Eating in secret.)

05:59.752 --> 06:00.950
(Don't let those two see.)

06:05.480 --> 06:07.639
I don't know
what happened with the ring.

06:10.560 --> 06:12.240
Ji'er is very competitive.

06:12.904 --> 06:14.430
She always wants to come out on top.

06:15.816 --> 06:17.290
Even when hanging out clothes to dry,

06:17.319 --> 06:18.879
she has to get a better spot than me.

06:20.800 --> 06:23.439
But in the six years we lived together,

06:25.000 --> 06:27.879
she never stole so much
as a needle or thread from anyone.

06:42.000 --> 06:43.879
My mother said
that when serving our masters,

06:43.950 --> 06:45.416
we must stay sharp and observant,

06:45.720 --> 06:46.759
and be quick on our feet.

06:47.040 --> 06:48.040
Listen to what we should,

06:48.070 --> 06:49.736
and ignore everything we shouldn't hear.

06:49.800 --> 06:51.600
Don't say anything we shouldn't.

06:51.620 --> 06:53.128
And even when we should say something,

06:53.576 --> 06:55.240
it's better not to if we can help it.

07:00.279 --> 07:01.040
Please, Yingge,

07:01.120 --> 07:02.319
say that again slowly.

07:02.376 --> 07:03.190
I didn't understand.

07:04.000 --> 07:05.319
Don't make me repeat myself.

07:05.439 --> 07:07.079
Just say it one last time.

07:10.959 --> 07:12.160
I'll show you an easy way.

07:14.480 --> 07:15.879
Just follow Lanxiang's lead.

07:21.079 --> 07:22.040
Lanxiang,

07:22.040 --> 07:23.519
I'll follow you from now on.

07:26.600 --> 07:28.759
Why are you clinging
to me like a little kitten?

07:34.959 --> 07:37.879
I'm barely able to look after myself.

07:38.439 --> 07:39.800
If you don't mind,

07:40.279 --> 07:41.319
then follow me.

07:46.399 --> 07:48.079
Only puppies wag their tails.

07:49.839 --> 07:52.680
She doesn't care
if it smells good or bad,

07:52.680 --> 07:53.600
as long as it works.

08:00.079 --> 08:01.120
Don't bite me.

08:01.519 --> 08:03.040
Bite me again and I'll tickle you.

08:03.040 --> 08:04.490
My mother says that in our courtyard,

08:04.500 --> 08:06.120
I'm the best at barking like a dog.

08:06.120 --> 08:06.879
Does it sound real?

08:24.720 --> 08:26.560
The air is dry.

08:26.639 --> 08:28.680
Beware of fire.

08:31.240 --> 08:32.440
These are for Lanxiang.

08:32.919 --> 08:36.240
The jacket, shoes,
and socks are all ready.

08:37.759 --> 08:38.639
Let me see.

08:42.000 --> 08:44.080
It's getting colder by the day.

08:45.559 --> 08:47.480
Still no word from her?

08:52.039 --> 08:53.200
It's all because I'm useless.

08:53.679 --> 08:54.960
I spent the money,

08:55.480 --> 08:57.240
but couldn't find anyone to help.

08:59.480 --> 09:00.279
You can't

09:01.240 --> 09:02.519
blame yourself for that.

09:03.679 --> 09:05.600
After all, she's
in Young Madam's courtyard.

09:17.159 --> 09:18.200
Who is it?

09:24.632 --> 09:27.208
(Chen Cuizhu, Du Xiaolian's Mother)
Are you Lanxiang's father?

09:28.399 --> 09:29.480
I'm Xiaolian's mother.

09:32.080 --> 09:34.080
Our daughters
entered the residence together.

09:34.080 --> 09:34.559
Yes.

09:34.559 --> 09:35.559
Come in.

09:35.759 --> 09:36.799
Please, come in.

09:39.399 --> 09:40.159
Madam.

09:40.559 --> 09:41.600
Please, have a seat.

09:41.600 --> 09:42.279
Sit down.

09:42.639 --> 09:44.440
I'll just say a few words
and be on my way.

09:45.960 --> 09:48.360
I heard you're looking

09:48.960 --> 09:51.120
for someone
who can enter the inner residence.

09:55.519 --> 09:56.279
Yes.

09:57.440 --> 09:59.360
Our daughter Lanxiang
entered the residence,

09:59.919 --> 10:01.360
and we can't help worrying about her.

10:01.559 --> 10:04.240
So we wanted to find someone
who could pass along a message

10:04.440 --> 10:05.600
or pass along a handkerchief,

10:05.879 --> 10:07.240
just so we know she's all right.

10:07.720 --> 10:08.240
Yes.

10:09.360 --> 10:10.679
I'm a night-soil collector.

10:11.279 --> 10:12.559
Before dawn every morning,

10:12.679 --> 10:15.000
I go to each courtyard
to collect the night soil.

10:16.519 --> 10:18.000
If you don't mind...

10:23.120 --> 10:23.879
Not at all.

10:23.919 --> 10:24.919
Not at all.

10:25.240 --> 10:26.080
That's wonderful.

10:26.120 --> 10:26.720
Yes.

10:28.200 --> 10:28.639
Right.

10:30.279 --> 10:33.039
These are the shoes I made
for my daughter Lanxiang,

10:33.080 --> 10:33.919
and the socks,

10:34.080 --> 10:35.639
and a newly sewn jacket.

10:37.200 --> 10:37.879
Thank you.

10:37.919 --> 10:38.360
All right.

10:39.560 --> 10:40.960
You haven't even had a sip of water.

10:40.960 --> 10:41.799
Next time.

10:44.120 --> 10:44.879
Another day,

10:45.039 --> 10:46.960
I'll come and thank you in person.

10:47.399 --> 10:49.120
I'll make a few dishes
and bring them over

10:49.159 --> 10:50.559
for you to try.

10:50.639 --> 10:51.240
Oh, please,

10:51.279 --> 10:53.240
don't say that.

10:53.559 --> 10:54.799
Xiaolian told us

10:54.919 --> 10:57.320
Lanxiang has always looked out for her.

10:57.720 --> 10:59.440
Our daughters were meant to meet,

10:59.480 --> 11:01.279
and so were our two families.

11:01.279 --> 11:01.759
Yes.

11:01.759 --> 11:03.220
No need to see me out.

11:03.260 --> 11:04.360
If you ever need anything,

11:04.360 --> 11:05.919
- just come to me.
- All right.

11:05.919 --> 11:06.720
Take care.

11:11.039 --> 11:11.919
Look,

11:11.976 --> 11:13.870
we spent money
and still couldn't get it done,

11:13.879 --> 11:16.240
but our Lanxiang
didn't spend a single coin

11:16.279 --> 11:17.559
and got it done for us.

11:17.559 --> 11:18.360
It's cold outside.

11:18.399 --> 11:19.600
Let's hurry back in.

11:21.720 --> 11:23.600
We can finally sleep well tonight.

11:36.500 --> 11:38.780
(Rongbao Pavilion)

11:52.040 --> 11:53.096
Young Master.

11:56.679 --> 11:57.320
Young Master.

11:59.840 --> 12:00.679
Shopkeeper Xu.

12:04.799 --> 12:06.159
You were the one who acquired

12:06.728 --> 12:08.240
Li Yingqiu's Cold Mountain Painting?

12:08.559 --> 12:09.720
I was just lucky.

12:11.144 --> 12:13.840
Young Master, would you like to see
some paintings and calligraphy,

12:13.960 --> 12:16.039
or perhaps some porcelain and jade?

12:17.600 --> 12:18.480
The account books.

12:25.960 --> 12:26.759
Young Master,

12:26.799 --> 12:28.080
this way, please.

12:34.600 --> 12:35.360
Get back to work.

13:06.759 --> 13:07.519
Young Master,

13:07.600 --> 13:10.440
since Qingxiang married
and moved to the capital,

13:10.639 --> 13:12.080
Zijin has taken over

13:12.240 --> 13:14.279
the money and accounts.

13:14.840 --> 13:16.159
Zijin

13:16.639 --> 13:18.519
can neither read nor do accounts.

13:18.840 --> 13:20.039
So whenever she comes,

13:20.200 --> 13:21.879
she doesn't check anything in person

13:22.200 --> 13:23.879
and simply takes everything away.

13:24.559 --> 13:25.320
However,

13:26.159 --> 13:28.399
I noticed that Zijin

13:28.679 --> 13:30.039
has an account book.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.279
Someone must be keeping the accounts.

13:35.279 --> 13:36.519
What's recorded inside?

13:37.559 --> 13:39.000
I didn't dare look too closely.

13:39.840 --> 13:42.840
But I run an antique shop,

13:42.840 --> 13:45.159
so I look at inscriptions
and seals every day.

13:45.759 --> 13:46.519
That's why

13:46.679 --> 13:49.600
I immediately
noticed a seal mark inside.

13:50.424 --> 13:51.544
I was afraid I'd forget it,

13:51.679 --> 13:54.039
so I quickly sketched it.

13:55.480 --> 13:57.519
It's not an exact copy,

13:57.840 --> 13:59.840
but it's about seventy
or eighty percent accurate.

14:16.620 --> 14:19.780
(Gold)

14:23.768 --> 14:25.250
It's one of a matching pair of seals.

14:26.440 --> 14:28.559
You have a keen eye, Young Master.

14:29.200 --> 14:30.639
It is indeed one of a matching pair.

14:30.840 --> 14:32.200
From my experience,

14:32.480 --> 14:33.960
the person keeping the accounts

14:34.480 --> 14:36.279
should have one seal,

14:36.519 --> 14:37.519
while Young Madam

14:38.480 --> 14:39.919
has the other.

14:41.320 --> 14:42.200
That way,

14:42.559 --> 14:44.200
the two of them don't need to meet.

14:44.320 --> 14:45.440
They can use the seals

14:45.919 --> 14:47.759
to verify the receipt
of money and goods.

14:54.320 --> 14:55.080
Well done.

14:57.000 --> 14:57.799
These past few days,

14:57.879 --> 15:00.120
I've followed
your instructions closely, Young Master,

15:00.159 --> 15:01.320
and kept everything as usual.

15:01.480 --> 15:03.840
Young Madam hasn't suspected a thing.

15:05.600 --> 15:06.759
But today,

15:07.200 --> 15:09.200
if you make this visit,

15:09.919 --> 15:11.240
I'm afraid we won't be able

15:11.250 --> 15:12.648
to keep it from Young Madam anymore.

15:15.039 --> 15:17.799
Then there's no need to hide it.

15:23.480 --> 15:24.600
You're right, Young Master.

15:36.080 --> 15:37.000
Are you cold?

15:38.279 --> 15:38.759
No.

15:39.032 --> 15:41.000
I'm wearing the padded jacket
my mother made me,

15:41.064 --> 15:42.320
with fresh silk floss inside,

15:42.600 --> 15:43.600
and thick socks too.

15:43.879 --> 15:44.759
I'm very warm.

15:45.816 --> 15:46.910
Thank your mother for me.

15:47.279 --> 15:48.759
Your parents really do cherish you.

15:49.519 --> 15:50.879
My parents do cherish me.

15:51.096 --> 15:53.320
My mother
and grandmother cherish me, too.

15:53.519 --> 15:54.000
Look.

15:54.088 --> 15:55.510
My grandmother just made this for me.

15:56.072 --> 15:57.048
My mother also said

15:57.080 --> 15:59.000
to thank you
for looking after me, a silly girl.

16:19.919 --> 16:20.960
Please let us pass.

16:22.399 --> 16:25.159
What brings you two precious ladies

16:25.159 --> 16:26.559
to fetch water yourselves today?

16:26.632 --> 16:28.670
What if you bump
into something and hurt yourselves?

16:28.919 --> 16:30.200
If Young Master blames us,

16:30.200 --> 16:31.360
what would we do?

16:32.039 --> 16:32.600
You...

16:33.399 --> 16:34.879
What nonsense are you talking about?

16:36.088 --> 16:37.750
Young Madam needs the water urgently.

16:38.159 --> 16:39.200
Please let us pass.

16:43.720 --> 16:45.639
Why is there a toad in the water?

16:46.840 --> 16:48.200
What toad?

16:50.000 --> 16:51.879
Isn't this a toad right here?

16:54.879 --> 16:56.360
You're the toad.

16:56.639 --> 16:58.080
At least I don't shamelessly

16:58.360 --> 16:59.759
dream of reaching for a swan.

17:02.799 --> 17:03.600
Lucao,

17:04.480 --> 17:05.839
may I ask who the swan is?

17:10.799 --> 17:12.799
It doesn't matter if you call us toads,

17:13.240 --> 17:14.319
but if someone hears

17:14.640 --> 17:16.359
that you compared
our master to an animal,

17:16.792 --> 17:18.790
I'm afraid it won't
end well for either of us.

17:28.400 --> 17:29.200
Please let us pass.

17:40.000 --> 17:55.440
♪The strings sound
as tales of family life are told♪

17:58.440 --> 18:16.640
♪In the Lion Grove
lives a family of officials♪

18:17.720 --> 18:22.400
♪Second Master Yang
serves as an official♪

18:25.680 --> 18:30.440
♪He pays no heed to matters at home♪

18:34.200 --> 18:40.279
♪Leaving his lovely wife neglected♪

18:41.200 --> 18:51.319
♪How could she
not be filled with sorrow?♪

18:55.400 --> 18:56.400
♪Sister-in-law♪

18:57.079 --> 19:01.319
♪I truly cannot drink any more♪

19:03.400 --> 19:04.200
♪Brother♪

19:04.640 --> 19:06.240
♪Have a few more cups♪

19:06.799 --> 19:08.799
♪It will do no harm♪

19:12.519 --> 19:15.599
♪Why are heaven
and earth both spinning?♪

19:16.319 --> 19:22.119
♪I mistake my sister-in-law
for my beloved♪

19:29.440 --> 19:32.359
♪Anger rises in my heart♪

19:33.119 --> 19:37.920
♪And evil grows within me♪

19:38.920 --> 19:44.960
♪The more I think about it,
the less I can bear it♪

19:45.720 --> 19:49.119
♪Today, I, Second Master Yang♪

19:49.240 --> 19:56.000
♪Will settle matters
with this adulterous woman♪

19:57.960 --> 19:58.720
Shut up!

20:00.559 --> 20:01.720
What kind of song is that?

20:03.560 --> 20:06.670
Young Madam, you said you wanted to hear
what's popular among the common folk,

20:06.680 --> 20:07.768
whether refined or vulgar.

20:33.400 --> 20:35.200
I'm not feeling well today.

20:35.440 --> 20:36.480
It's giving me a headache.

20:37.160 --> 20:38.160
You may all leave.

20:40.039 --> 20:40.839
Xiaolian,

20:40.960 --> 20:42.319
see the storyteller out first.

20:52.880 --> 20:53.680
My Lady,

20:53.960 --> 20:55.830
it must have been scorched
by the foot warmer

20:55.880 --> 20:57.359
when it fell just now.

21:02.960 --> 21:03.880
Lanxiang,

21:23.240 --> 21:25.319
I heard your mother
used to work in the sewing room.

21:26.359 --> 21:28.039
You must be
quite good at needlework, too.

21:28.599 --> 21:31.079
This silver fox fur
is one of my favorites.

21:31.880 --> 21:33.799
Take it back and mend it for me.

21:36.400 --> 21:37.480
If you do a good job,

21:38.160 --> 21:39.400
I'll naturally reward you.

21:40.119 --> 21:41.440
If you don't,

21:41.640 --> 21:43.359
I'll certainly punish you.

21:54.200 --> 21:55.599
Why aren't you saying anything?

21:56.400 --> 21:58.000
Are you unwilling to do it?

21:59.920 --> 22:00.920
Young Madam,

22:01.160 --> 22:04.359
I was thinking
about how best to mend it.

22:07.400 --> 22:08.319
Look, Young Madam.

22:08.960 --> 22:11.200
The damaged part is along the hem.

22:11.519 --> 22:13.640
Why not trim the edge

22:13.680 --> 22:15.240
with purple sable tails?

22:15.720 --> 22:16.880
Silver fox with purple sable

22:16.936 --> 22:18.400
would be distinctive and beautiful.

22:18.559 --> 22:21.359
There surely wouldn't
be another like it in Jinling City.

22:28.872 --> 22:29.368
Young Madam,

22:29.370 --> 22:31.710
these are the new fabrics
that just arrived at Jinxiu House.

22:31.720 --> 22:33.359
The shopkeeper
had them sent over for you.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.759
And this month's accounts

22:34.799 --> 22:35.960
were sent along with them.

22:37.380 --> 22:39.780
(Jinxiu House Account Book)

22:51.359 --> 22:52.440
Take them back for now.

22:52.640 --> 22:53.839
I'll look at them tonight.

22:55.440 --> 22:56.160
Yes.

23:03.519 --> 23:06.880
What you said
about silver fox and purple sable

23:08.039 --> 23:09.400
does sound rather distinctive.

23:10.160 --> 23:11.480
Can you really do it?

23:13.032 --> 23:15.450
I've been doing needlework
with my mother since I was little.

23:15.880 --> 23:17.400
I'm fairly confident I can.

23:18.599 --> 23:20.039
Then you'd better be careful.

23:20.799 --> 23:22.559
You can't be off
by even the slightest bit.

23:52.000 --> 23:52.640
(Young Madam.)

23:52.720 --> 23:55.192
(These are the new fabrics
that just arrived at Jinxiu House.)

23:55.559 --> 23:56.960
(And this month's accounts)

23:56.960 --> 23:58.160
(were sent along with them.)

24:05.320 --> 24:06.936
(This is one of the matching seals.)

24:08.799 --> 24:10.759
But why is there nothing engraved on it?

24:11.839 --> 24:14.240
This is a dowry gift
I had specially made for you.

24:14.872 --> 24:16.632
It's called
a pair of mandarin duck seals.

24:16.792 --> 24:18.392
When the characters are engraved,

24:18.720 --> 24:20.000
one seal is carved in relief,

24:20.200 --> 24:21.440
and the other in intaglio,

24:22.400 --> 24:24.759
symbolizing the harmony of yin and yang

24:24.880 --> 24:26.079
and two hearts as one.

24:27.200 --> 24:28.599
Once you marry into the Lin family,

24:28.759 --> 24:30.880
you and your husband
can each keep one seal.

24:32.160 --> 24:33.480
As for what characters to engrave,

24:34.440 --> 24:36.200
the two of you
can decide for yourselves.

24:37.559 --> 24:38.400
Mother.

24:40.759 --> 24:41.480
Lanxiang.

24:42.759 --> 24:43.519
Lanxiang.

24:46.039 --> 24:47.039
Lanxiang!

24:49.920 --> 24:50.720
Let me tell you.

24:50.759 --> 24:53.160
The opera today was so good.

24:53.672 --> 24:56.240
It's a shame Young Madam had
a headache and didn't hear the rest.

25:00.759 --> 25:03.160
Do you want to know
what happened afterward?

25:06.119 --> 25:07.079
What happened?

25:08.119 --> 25:09.680
When I saw the storyteller out,

25:09.880 --> 25:11.359
she told me everything.

25:11.440 --> 25:14.599
Later, Second Master Yang killed
the adulterous pair with one slash.

25:14.920 --> 25:16.480
Then, fearing the scandal would spread

25:16.599 --> 25:17.559
and disgrace his family,

25:17.920 --> 25:21.720
he killed several of the older maids
and young maids in the household, too.

25:25.079 --> 25:25.559
Yang...

25:34.359 --> 25:37.039
I was startled
when I first heard it, too.

25:37.759 --> 25:38.839
The storyteller said

25:38.840 --> 25:41.180
when the madam of the house
commits such a disgraceful act,

25:41.190 --> 25:42.590
the servants who attend her closely,

25:42.600 --> 25:45.079
whether they truly knew nothing
or merely claimed not to,

25:45.240 --> 25:46.839
could hardly escape death.

25:57.079 --> 25:57.880
Lanxiang.

25:58.519 --> 25:59.440
Lanxiang.

26:00.599 --> 26:01.400
What's wrong?

26:01.599 --> 26:02.759
Did that scare you?

26:05.839 --> 26:06.559
Yes.

26:07.039 --> 26:08.759
You keep talking about people dying.

26:09.200 --> 26:10.839
It's making me uneasy.

26:12.640 --> 26:13.279
All right.

26:13.400 --> 26:14.279
I won't say any more.

26:17.279 --> 26:19.559
Just imagine, the blade was this big.

26:20.519 --> 26:22.839
One slash
with that would be so dangerous.

26:27.759 --> 26:30.160
I can't even
tell this part was burned.

26:31.032 --> 26:32.790
Young Madam,
would you like to try it on?

26:45.680 --> 26:46.519
It's beautiful.

26:46.568 --> 26:48.550
There truly isn't
another like it in Jinling City.

26:49.039 --> 26:51.319
Only you could carry off
such splendor, Young Madam.

27:02.319 --> 27:03.039
Not bad.

27:04.039 --> 27:05.759
I can see you
put a lot of thought into it.

27:06.640 --> 27:07.960
I should naturally do my utmost

27:08.000 --> 27:09.400
when serving Young Madam.

27:12.720 --> 27:13.599
Young Master is here.

27:13.640 --> 27:15.079
Quickly prepare some hot tea for him.

27:18.200 --> 27:18.960
Young Master.

27:19.279 --> 27:20.000
Young Master.

27:20.279 --> 27:22.079
Young Madam is resting inside.

27:40.920 --> 27:41.960
No wonder

27:41.960 --> 27:43.848
the northwest wind
howled all night yesterday.

27:44.160 --> 27:45.640
It sounded like ghosts wailing.

27:46.400 --> 27:49.400
I wondered what was causing
such a commotion.

27:49.480 --> 27:51.599
So that's what
blew you here, Young Master.

27:55.000 --> 27:57.680
I need your help with something today.

27:58.839 --> 28:00.240
Now that's a rarity.

28:01.079 --> 28:02.240
Go on, Young Master.

28:02.264 --> 28:03.688
What do you need my help with?

28:07.799 --> 28:10.079
I have a squad leader under my command

28:10.440 --> 28:11.319
named Du Zheng.

28:11.512 --> 28:13.768
When we fought the Japanese
pirates the year before last,

28:13.839 --> 28:15.079
he took a blow meant for me.

28:16.079 --> 28:17.119
When I returned to Jinling,

28:17.599 --> 28:19.319
I had him transferred back from Jinzhou

28:19.448 --> 28:20.840
and promoted to company commander.

28:21.839 --> 28:22.920
He has no parents

28:23.440 --> 28:25.240
and only a younger sister
who depends on him.

28:27.000 --> 28:28.319
She has nowhere to go now.

28:29.208 --> 28:30.880
I've already
obtained Mother's permission

28:31.319 --> 28:33.799
to let her move into
the Lin Residence and stay here.

28:37.880 --> 28:39.440
Since First Madam has already agreed,

28:39.920 --> 28:41.319
I'll see to it.

28:44.440 --> 28:45.880
Luxue Lodge is vacant.

28:46.559 --> 28:48.319
Young Lady Du can stay there.

28:48.880 --> 28:51.680
As for her food,
clothing, and other expenses,

28:51.800 --> 28:54.088
she'll be treated the same
as one of our own young ladies.

28:54.640 --> 28:56.039
We mustn't let anyone say

28:56.359 --> 28:58.119
the Lin family
has slighted our benefactor.

29:01.010 --> 29:02.880
I think Luxue Lodge
is the most suitable, too.

29:05.528 --> 29:07.640
It's just that the place
has been vacant for so long

29:07.640 --> 29:09.752
and needs some repairs
before anyone can live there.

29:11.480 --> 29:12.240
As for the money...

29:15.480 --> 29:16.599
Young Master's benefactor

29:17.039 --> 29:18.559
is also a benefactor of the Lin family.

29:20.119 --> 29:22.279
It should naturally
come from the family funds.

29:25.079 --> 29:26.279
Then please stamp your seal.

29:26.600 --> 29:28.590
I'll have Jiugao
collect the money right away

29:28.776 --> 29:30.344
and hire craftsmen to begin the work.

29:30.480 --> 29:32.740
Let's get her settled
in before the Chinese New Year

29:32.759 --> 29:34.319
so she won't have to spend it all alone.

29:46.279 --> 29:48.759
Young Master is truly thoughtful.

29:51.279 --> 29:52.039
Zijin.

29:52.799 --> 29:54.079
Bring me my seal.

30:09.519 --> 30:11.160
There are so many seals in there.

30:11.920 --> 30:13.559
I don't know which one it is.

30:14.720 --> 30:16.599
You're utterly useless.

30:47.880 --> 30:48.680
Young Madam.

30:54.599 --> 30:55.599
The craftsmen can't read

30:55.640 --> 30:56.710
and won't accept banknotes.

30:56.720 --> 30:58.190
They want payment entirely in silver.

30:58.200 --> 31:00.170
Do you need to ask me
about such a trivial matter?

31:00.280 --> 31:02.120
Get it from
the accounts office, of course.

31:02.300 --> 31:04.300
(Lin Jiugao)

31:35.759 --> 31:36.599
Zijin.

32:10.359 --> 32:11.359
I've picked them all up.

32:12.039 --> 32:13.240
Luckily, none of them broke.

32:23.039 --> 32:24.279
My Lady...

32:35.192 --> 32:36.184
I'll leave you to it.

32:36.376 --> 32:37.710
I still have things to attend to.

32:37.720 --> 32:38.319
I'll be going.

32:39.359 --> 32:40.279
I won't see you out.

32:51.680 --> 32:53.480
If Young Madam
has no other instructions,

32:53.519 --> 32:54.519
I'll take my leave.

32:57.200 --> 32:57.960
Go.

33:16.920 --> 33:18.240
Where's my seal?

33:18.880 --> 33:20.200
Did Jiugao steal it?

33:20.680 --> 33:21.759
Did he?

33:21.960 --> 33:22.960
I don't know.

33:23.519 --> 33:24.319
I'll look again.

33:24.559 --> 33:25.400
I'll look again.

33:27.864 --> 33:28.400
My Lady!

33:28.559 --> 33:29.160
My Lady!

33:29.240 --> 33:30.119
It's all my fault.

33:30.240 --> 33:31.079
I was careless.

33:31.200 --> 33:31.720
My Lady!

33:32.759 --> 33:33.799
Useless fool.

33:33.799 --> 33:34.400
My Lady!

33:34.559 --> 33:36.200
It's all my fault. It's all my fault!

33:36.240 --> 33:37.440
You're useless at everything.

33:38.039 --> 33:39.200
Hurry up and look for it!

33:46.240 --> 33:47.000
My Lady.

33:49.000 --> 33:49.759
My Lady.

33:50.319 --> 33:51.279
My Lady!

33:51.680 --> 33:53.000
What are you shrieking about?

33:56.319 --> 33:56.920
My Lady...

33:57.279 --> 33:58.319
The seal...

34:14.480 --> 34:16.400
Could this place be haunted?

34:17.599 --> 34:19.559
Haunted in broad daylight?

34:20.599 --> 34:21.679
You can't even measure up

34:21.679 --> 34:23.239
to half of Qingxiang.

34:23.400 --> 34:24.679
Then how did it suddenly

34:24.679 --> 34:26.239
appear right under our noses?

34:44.239 --> 34:45.039
It wasn't a ghost.

34:45.840 --> 34:46.599
It was this.

34:49.880 --> 34:50.480
The fox...

34:51.110 --> 34:52.744
The Fox Immortal has revealed itself!

34:56.320 --> 34:57.400
Look carefully.

35:28.119 --> 35:31.440
So it was wrapped up
in the silver fox fur.

35:32.360 --> 35:33.440
No wonder, when I

35:33.510 --> 35:35.464
accidentally dropped
the silver fox fur just now,

35:35.639 --> 35:36.679
it rolled out.

35:42.760 --> 35:45.119
They say the Lin family
brings me nothing but trouble,

35:48.840 --> 35:49.920
but this Lanxiang

35:50.800 --> 35:53.119
has helped me greatly by sheer chance.

35:54.199 --> 35:55.800
Take a silver ring you don't like

35:57.639 --> 35:58.480
and say

35:59.519 --> 36:01.320
it's a reward from Young Madam

36:01.679 --> 36:04.039
for mending the silver fox fur so well.

36:05.199 --> 36:06.079
Yes.

36:35.719 --> 36:36.920
(Then please stamp your seal.)

36:37.519 --> 36:38.760
(Bring me my seal.)

36:49.840 --> 36:50.599
Young Madam.

36:52.104 --> 36:54.584
(When the madam of the house
commits such a disgraceful act,)

36:54.590 --> 36:56.100
(the servants who attend her closely,)

36:56.119 --> 36:58.559
(whether they truly knew nothing
or merely claimed not to,)

36:58.840 --> 37:00.280
(could hardly escape death.)

37:08.480 --> 37:09.400
Zijin.

37:51.620 --> 37:55.540
(Money)

38:10.599 --> 38:11.800
(Young Madam loves money.)

38:12.088 --> 38:13.480
(The person keeping the accounts)

38:13.800 --> 38:15.199
(should be a woman,)

38:15.920 --> 38:17.079
(just like Qingxiang.)

38:19.320 --> 38:20.680
(Gold)
The character for "gold".

38:20.710 --> 38:22.472
Young Master,
why do you keep staring at it?

38:23.559 --> 38:25.199
It looks like the character for "gold",

38:27.880 --> 38:29.590
but if Huang Youzhi
didn't see it clearly

38:29.599 --> 38:30.960
in his haste,

38:31.800 --> 38:34.280
and the final stroke slanted upward,

38:36.880 --> 38:38.440
then it would only be a radical.

38:40.119 --> 38:41.599
Young Madam loves silver so much.

38:41.800 --> 38:43.130
Using the character
for "money" on her matching seals

38:43.144 --> 38:44.296
would suit her perfectly.

38:46.280 --> 38:47.360
You think

38:48.360 --> 38:49.599
it's the character for "money"?

38:54.239 --> 38:54.960
I...

38:56.039 --> 38:57.760
was just making a wild guess.

38:58.559 --> 38:59.719
It could be "copper"

39:00.280 --> 39:01.280
or perhaps "blade".

39:02.239 --> 39:04.840
There are many characters
with the metal radical.

39:05.880 --> 39:07.079
It doesn't have to be "money".

39:08.719 --> 39:10.639
Could it really
be the character for "money"?

39:14.920 --> 39:15.480
Young Master.

39:15.760 --> 39:16.600
I've looked into it.

39:17.360 --> 39:19.320
The day after you visited

39:19.559 --> 39:20.280
Rongbao Pavilion,

39:20.440 --> 39:22.239
Jinxiu House
sent fabrics to the residence.

39:23.039 --> 39:23.920
Two days later,

39:24.039 --> 39:25.360
Zijin went to Rongbao Pavilion

39:25.384 --> 39:27.848
and asked Huang Youzhi
about you checking the accounts.

39:28.400 --> 39:30.119
Huang Youzhi said
he hadn't said anything.

39:31.840 --> 39:32.760
From the looks of it,

39:33.360 --> 39:34.760
Jinxiu House may well

39:36.639 --> 39:38.320
be tipping Young Madam off.

39:42.199 --> 39:44.920
Jinxiu House was part
of Young Madam's dowry.

39:46.360 --> 39:47.440
Every month, Young Madam

39:47.544 --> 39:49.190
visits her shops to check the accounts.

39:50.039 --> 39:53.599
She visits Jinxiu House most often.

39:58.280 --> 39:59.199
What a coincidence.

40:01.599 --> 40:02.599
It seems

40:03.679 --> 40:05.199
we need to investigate

40:05.719 --> 40:06.840
Jinxiu House.

40:11.144 --> 40:14.180
(Gold)

40:39.064 --> 40:40.824
Young Master
is investigating the accounts.

40:41.440 --> 40:44.840
Young Madam, perhaps you
shouldn't go to Jinxiu House.

40:45.656 --> 40:47.128
No matter how much he investigates,

40:47.920 --> 40:50.280
he won't find his way
into the accounts of my dowry shops.

40:52.800 --> 40:53.559
Besides,

40:54.040 --> 40:56.639
even if he finds out I've been
making usurious loans, so what?

40:58.280 --> 41:00.880
If he's capable, he can divorce me.

41:01.519 --> 41:02.719
I'd be more than happy.

41:18.024 --> 41:20.312
You two have been
in the residence for quite some time,

41:20.344 --> 41:22.392
but neither of you
has ever gone out with me.

41:22.920 --> 41:24.440
Who wants to go out today?

41:39.760 --> 41:41.719
Young Madam, I do.

41:47.519 --> 41:48.679
Nanny Feng, Lanxiang,

41:49.880 --> 41:51.039
come with me.

42:04.620 --> 42:07.740
(Jinxiu House)

42:29.880 --> 42:30.400
Young Madam.

42:30.400 --> 42:31.719
(Liu Sande,
Head Shopkeeper of Jinxiu House)

42:31.720 --> 42:32.504
Please come inside.

42:35.840 --> 42:37.719
This is one
of Young Madam's dowry shops.

42:37.816 --> 42:39.992
Young Madam comes once
a month to check the accounts.

42:40.040 --> 42:42.280
To avoid disturbing
the customers and affecting business,

42:42.320 --> 42:44.350
she always enters
and leaves through the back door.

42:44.360 --> 42:45.912
Thank you for teaching me, Madam Feng.

42:50.480 --> 42:52.199
Madam Feng, Lanxiang,

42:52.679 --> 42:53.920
wait downstairs.

42:54.440 --> 42:55.079
- Yes.
- Yes.

42:55.920 --> 42:56.679
Shopkeeper Liu.

42:57.144 --> 42:58.190
Go tell Young Lady Qian

42:58.239 --> 42:59.719
to bring all the account books.

43:05.260 --> 43:07.740
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:10.440 --> 43:11.519
Be my ears

43:12.519 --> 43:13.320
and eyes.

43:14.360 --> 43:15.240
Everything you hear

43:15.288 --> 43:17.670
and see while you're with Zhao Xingtang,

43:18.239 --> 43:19.199
report it all to me.

43:20.880 --> 43:22.320
If you do this well,

43:23.639 --> 43:24.679
I guarantee

43:27.352 --> 43:28.670
your whole family will be safe.

43:49.620 --> 43:53.740
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

43:56.580 --> 44:01.100
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:02.380 --> 44:06.300
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:06.980 --> 44:09.740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:10.460 --> 44:12.780
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:12.780 --> 44:15.860
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:17.380 --> 44:21.620
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:24.540 --> 44:28.700
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:30.500 --> 44:34.060
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:34.060 --> 44:37.620
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:38.420 --> 44:44.100
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:44.460 --> 44:48.780
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:49.140 --> 44:52.100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:52.100 --> 44:55.860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

44:55.860 --> 44:58.740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

44:58.740 --> 45:02.820
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:02.820 --> 45:06.180
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:06.180 --> 45:09.940
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:09.940 --> 45:13.940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:14.700 --> 45:18.860
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:18.860 --> 45:22.300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:22.300 --> 45:25.940
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:25.940 --> 45:28.820
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:28.820 --> 45:32.900
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:32.900 --> 45:36.260
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:36.260 --> 45:39.900
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:39.900 --> 45:47.700
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
